### Featured Project: IndiGo Self-Service Boarding Kiosk Redesign

> **Airport Self-Check-in & Boarding Pass Kiosk | UI/UX Case Study**  
> A high-efficiency kiosk interface redesign crafted to streamline passenger check-in and reduce airport terminal bottlenecks. Guided by Human-Computer Interaction (HCI) principles, the redesigned flow simplifies baggage tag issuance, improves touch-target ergonomics, and minimizes cognitive load under high-pressure transit environments.

* **Domain:** Aviation / Self-Service Kiosk / HCI  
* **Role:** UI/UX Designer  
* **Tools:** Figma  
* **Key Focus:** Touchscreen Ergonomics, Rapid Information Architecture, Accessibility, Frictionless Check-in  
